2026-09-22T03:46:03.4552149Z     The ``pytest`` framework makes it easy to write small tests, yet
2026-09-22T03:46:03.4552265Z     scales to support complex functional testing for applications and libraries.
2026-09-22T03:46:03.4552308Z     
2026-09-22T03:46:03.4552366Z     An example of a simple test:
2026-09-22T03:46:03.4552407Z     
